OL,3,A'This is despicable': Amy Acton
OL,4,Aresponds to Ohio attack ad featuring
OL,5,Aher estranged mother
OL,6,
OL,7,FAmy Acton, the Democratic candidate for
OL,8,Fgovernor of the US state of Ohio, has
OL,9,Fcalled an attack ad against her that
OL,10,Ffeatures her estranged mother
OL,11,F"despicable".
OL,13,FActon commented on the campaign ad from
OL,14,Fher Republican opponent, Vivek
OL,15,FRamaswamy, on Wednesday evening,
OL,16,Fsaying: "This is despicable, what he's
OL,17,Fdone".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
