OL,3,A'This is despicable': Amy Acton
OL,4,Aresponds to Ohio attack ad featuring
OL,5,Aher estranged mother
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the ad Acton's mother, Donna Arthur,
OL,8,Fsays Acton "lied her entire life". But
OL,9,Fit does not mention that Arthur's
OL,10,Fhusband was charged with raping Acton
OL,11,Fwhen she was a child and that Acton and
OL,12,Fher brother were then removed from
OL,13,FArthur's custody.
OL,15,FSince it launched on Monday, the ad has
OL,16,Fgenerated political backlash and cast a
OL,17,Fnational spotlight on the race.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
